# DOOM1.WAD E1M5: from the start, walk north down the 16-unit step into the
# nukage (no damage: the reference has no sector specials, as the sim before
# T5.8), run about in it, turn round and step back up out of it.
iwad doom1
map E1M5
25 0 0 0 x25
50 0 4 0 x30
0 0 64 0 x2
50 -24 0 0 x40
0 0 0 0 x10
